<p>
The main tool (a part from git :) for taking the most of this
document is EMACS, you want to have it installed.
</p>

<ul class="org-ul">
<li><a href="https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/">https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/</a></li>
</ul>

<p>
I'm using EMACS since 2017 for Instant Project Management, TimeSheet
management, GTD and other cool stuff like to support this
document. Emacs is mainly the key-factor for many features and tricks
that I'm doing in my everyday workflow stream.
</p>

<div class="org-src-container">
<pre class="src src-sh">
