emacs to back-up (just in case), and then will clone the latest
stable repository for espacemacs.
</p>

<div class="org-src-container">
<pre class="src src-sh">
mv ~/.emacs.d ~/.emacs.d.old
git clone https://github.com/syl20bnr/spacemacs ~/.emacs.d

</pre>
</div>

<p>
With version 25 (current version is 27 by the time of writing) of
EMACS in Ubuntu 18 i found an issue, related to signature update,
if you find yourself again with this error you can solve it
following the instructions:
</p>

<p>
You can check your linux version with the following code:
