<div id="outline-container-orge9cca63" class="outline-4">
<h4 id="orge9cca63"><span class="section-number-4">5.3.1</span> reveal-js for Spaceemacs configuration</h4>
<div class="outline-text-4" id="text-5-3-1">
<p>
A part from LibreOffice suite you may want to have a powerfull tool for presentation. 
This is for sure reveal.js, you can include it in your org configuration adding in your user layer <b><i>dotspacemacs-configuration-layers</i></b>  inside <b><i>dotspacemacs/layers</i></b> the following
</p>

<div class="org-src-container">
<pre class="src src-lisp">org
(org :variables
     org-enable-github-support t
     org-enable-reveal-js-support t)
</pre>
</div>

<p>
This configuration is included in the <b>.spacemacs</b> file. 
</p>
