<p>
I'm just trying this, for me is good to have more focus on the
work, avoiding disrruption and because of this I'm trying i3.
</p>

<p>
I tricked some battery problems with the i3status bar, there is a
.conf file in this repo that you can use:
</p>

<div class="org-src-container">
<pre class="src src-sh">
cp ./i3/.i3status.conf ~/

</pre>
</div>

<p>
Documentation can be found here:
<a href="https://i3wm.org/docs/userguide.html#_default_keybindings">https://i3wm.org/docs/userguide.html#_default_keybindings</a>
